      "adlib": false
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0,
      "members": [],
      "original": "또 하루만큼 멀어진 듯해도",
      "romanization": "tto harumankeum meoreojin deuthaedo",
      "english": "Even if it feels like we’ve grown a day farther apart",
      "adlib": false
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0,
      "members": [],
      "original": "내 옆에서 웃는 너를 보면",
      "romanization": "nae yeopeseo utneun neoreul bomyeon",
      "english": "When I see you smiling beside me",
      "adlib": false
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0,
      "members": [],
      "original": "멈춰지지가 않아서 난",
      "romanization": "meomchwojijiga anaseo nan",
